      "about": {
        "description": "**SATURDAY 12TH DECEMBER / DOORS & BARS OPEN 6.30PM / LIVE SHOW & MOVIE FROM 7.30PM / 18+**\n\n**“If you look for it, we’ve got a sneaky feeling you’ll find that Love, Christmas and Drinking are all around us…” Even if you do have to try and squeeze an extra syllables to make it work 😂**\n\nOur Love Actually Movie Nights are legendary! We’ll be bringing back our world famous ‘Ant or Dec’ competition, the prosecco-tastic drink-along, prizes for best fancy dress, all the Lobster Octopus outfits, countless crowdsurfing Hugh Grant cardboard cut outs, a Club, Actually Xmas Disco after & the movie on our ENORMOUS screen! 🎬\n\nExpect:\n\nThe movie on our massive screen 📺\n\nSnow machines, confetti & balloon drops ❄️\n\nLive host & show team 🕺\n\nSingalong carols, games & dance-offs 🎄\n\nPrizes for best costumes 🏆\n\nEntry into our Club, Actually Afterparty 🪩\n\nThe Grand’s cocktails & mulled wine 🍷\n\nPigs in blankets, hotdogs & nachos, courtesy of Hot Beige (yes, vegany goodness too!) 🐷\n\nPopcorn for £3 🍿\n\nOur Christmas Movie Nights are like no other, alongside watching the movie uninterrupted on our massive (25 ft!) screen, we have a whole lot more in store for you before & after the film, including The Grand's live hosts & show team, mulled wine, mince pies, confetti, snow machines, the occasional balloon drop 🎈\n\nFeel free to sing-along, heckle the bad guys and cheer for your heroes, a costume is never un-appreciated (in fact we often give out prizes for the best or worst), the bar & food stalls stay open during the movie and sometimes afterwards there’s a club night to top things off!\n\n**AGE RESTRICTIONS 😉** We are afraid our Movie Nights are for over 18s, the films might be suitable for kids, but our show teams humour might not be!\n\n**If you have any questions please scroll down to the FAQ section below.**",
