      "about": {
        "description": "**FRIDAY 8TH JANUARY / DOORS & BARS OPEN 7PM / MOVIE & SHOW FROM 8PM / MINI DISCO TIL APPROX 11.30PM / 18+**\n\n**You remind me of The Movie Night. What Movie Night? The Labyrinth Movie Night on a massive screen, with themed cocktails, dance offs & mini Bowie disco! 🪩**\n\nWell, come on then! Join Jareth, Hoggle, Ludo, Sarah & hundreds of Labyrinth lovers in (re) watching the cult classic uninterrupted in our gloirous listed Victorian Theatre 🎬\n\nOur Dreamteam hosts are bringing back the famous Dance Magic Dance-Off & there’s prizes for the best fancy dress in the Goblin King Costume Parade. We've also got themed cocktails (Porn-Star Man-tini or Bog of Eternal Stench fish bowl anyone...?) plus a whole lotta Hot Beige to eat including Bowie's Bulge (hot) dogs, nachos & popcorn 🔮\n\nPost-movie we're throwing a mini Bowie Disco, playing all your fave Bowie classics plus plenty of 70s & 80s bangers 🎵 What better way to celebrate what would be the great man’s birthday weekend 🎂\n\nFeel free to sing-along, heckle the bad guys and cheer for your heroes, a costume is never un-appreciated (in fact we often give out prizes for the best or worst), the bar & food stalls stay open during the movie and sometimes afterwards there’s a club night to top things off!\n\n**If you have any questions please scroll down to the FAQ section below.**",
