      "about": {
        "description": "**SATURDAY 6TH FEBUARY / DOORS & BARS OPEN 12PM / BOTTOMLESS HOUR STARTS 1PM / MOVIE, SHOW & GAMES FROM 1.30PM / MINI DISNEY DISCO 'TIL 4.30PM / 18+**\n\n**It's time to Bop To The Top 'coz our legendary High School Movie Bottomless Brunch Party is back!**\n\nThese parties went viral on TikTok last year and over 5K Disney Channel lovers have already come to party with us 🪩 So, gather your fellow Wild Cats for...\n\nAn hour of bottomless bubbles (it's 1-2pm so make sure you're on time!) 🍾\n\nThe whole first movie on our massive screen 📽️\n\nWe’re All In This Together mass sing-a-long🎙️\n\nDisney Channel mini disco 🕺\n\nShow stopping performances from our Wild Cat Dreamteam 🤩\n\nPrizes for the best costumes 👗\n\nGet’cha Head in the Game competition 🏆\n\nHotdogs & Nachos courtesy of Hot Beige with vegan options 🌭\n\nPopcorn for £3 🍿\n\n**\\-**\n\nFeel free to sing-along, heckle the bad guys and cheer for your heroes, a costume is never un-appreciated (in fact we often give out prizes for the best or worst), the bar & food stalls stay open during the movie and sometimes afterwards there’s a club night to top things off!\n\n**Last entry 1pm.**\n\n**If you have any questions please scroll down to the FAQ section below.**",
